   "id": 1,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "PERSONAL PLOT\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 5, CC 49 to 64\n   1 Own plot weight\n   2 Own plot meets the main plot\n   3 What they want, against what they need\n   4 Secret\n   5 Closer to or further from the goal\n   6 Questions the audience is holding\n   7 A clock running out\n   8 Who knows first\n   9 suite: Hidden agenda\n  10 suite: Chasing the wrong thing\n  11 suite: We know, they don't\n  12 suite: Bomb under the table\n  13 suite: Whodunit hook\n  14 suite: Two steps forward, one back\n  15 pair: When a secret starts slipping, cringe rises\n  16 pair: When the character is set back, their emotional road drops\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 5, CC 65 to 76\n   1 pair: When a scene ends on a cliffhanger, the audience's questions rise\n   2 pair: When the opening grabs with a question, a question opens\n   3 pair: When the clock gets tight, the scenes speed up\n   4 pair: When the audience knows first, every calm moment fills with dread\n   5 pair: When a side story grows heavy enough, it gets pulled into the main plot\n   6 pair: When a side story merges into the main plot, the stakes jump\n   7 pair: When what they want is the opposite of what they need, they fight the change\n   8 pair: When what they want finally lines up with what they need, they act on what they believe\n   9 pairs: Secrets and lies\n  10 pairs: Questions pull the audience forward\n  11 pairs: Knowing too much\n  12 pairs: The side story takes over"
   },
   "pos": [
